Start with no updates when updates.json holds malformed entries

The loader now checks every entry has the shape record() writes (string
image, digest, hubLink, created; a list of string containers; a numeric
received). Before, a file that parsed but had a wrong-shaped entry loaded and
then raised KeyError/TypeError on every /api/state, taking the dashboard down.

Files: pihub/updates.py, tests/test_updates.py
